		{"id":"08940f8774e99617","type":"text","text":"+ Using packed geometry (representing pieces as points) for RBD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XzlZDgr3s8c\n+ Particles and RBD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=edPvHXKvOtg\n+ RBD and morphing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UjSpiFwD9lM\n+ Vellum RBD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G5K-0wqEJsU\n+ Bullet RBD: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KOXn5WECmsA\n+ Fracturing: \n\t+ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHYelaEFmr8\n\t+ https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/smashing-wine-glass/\n+ Interesting examples:\n\t+ https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/discovering-houdini-rbd-3/\n\t+ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DA6sq1mCMyU","x":-470,"y":-746,"width":697,"height":371},
