		{"id":"208a4d250fdde248","type":"text","text":"Houdini practical examples:\n* Vellum:\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ge2W7KKwf8\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h0iAAY8Zpq0\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iejHx2AczJk\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=creZnjGQTxk\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d1ZxZ68X87g\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmoBS9S-8h0\n\t* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/shelf/vellumtetsoftbody.html\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WvTS5xHQUeY\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mVqr08H8Iyc\n* FEM:\n\t* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/femdeform.html\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=goqG2t4WYoI\n* Ideas:\n\t* https://entagma.com/courses/vellum-101/","x":-259,"y":1608,"width":755,"height":493},
